## 1. PURPOSE AND UNIFICATION

This Unified Licence and Documentation Notice records the licensing architecture applicable to documentation and software-oriented work designated by HIM Dr. Avinandan Manjit Roy I, including:

1. **Creative Commons documentation (CC BY-ND 4.0);**
2. **Memorandum of Due / AUM documentation**, including AUM identification, ODS/ODS Retrieval, ORDINEXT and associated execution records;
3. **Psychiatric / medical / therapeutic practice documentation**, including administrative, constitutional, tariff, therapeutic and practice materials designated by the Principal; and
4. **Apache-compatible software materials**, source code, documentation or components expressly marked as Apache License, Version 2.0.

The purpose is to place these layers under one **attribution, indexing and separation framework**, without silently changing the licence governing any individual component.

