## 10. INTEGRITY AND NO-DERIVATIVE INSULATION

For CC BY-ND-designated material, the NoDerivatives condition remains governed by CC BY-ND 4.0. The source states that Adapted Material may be produced and reproduced but may not be Shared under that licence. fileciteturn6file3

Nothing in an Apache-compatible software layer authorizes sharing an adapted version of a separate CC BY-ND work.

Where an Apache-licensed software component is combined in a repository with documentation under another licence, the component's licence remains separately identifiable.

