A cryptographic hash identifies a particular digital file state; it does not by itself establish authorship, legal validity, medical registration, government recognition, or third-party verification.

## 12. MEDICAL AND THERAPEUTIC PRACTICE SAFEGUARD

This licence architecture concerns intellectual-property, documentation and repository permissions.

It does not itself:

- authorize diagnosis or treatment;
- establish medical registration;
- establish psychotherapy licensure;
- establish regulatory approval;
- substitute for informed consent;
- replace applicable professional standards;
- override applicable health, privacy, medical-device, pharmaceutical, or other regulation; or
- establish that any therapeutic method is clinically validated.

Those matters remain subject to applicable jurisdiction, professional requirements and specific practice documentation.

